PROJECT: PantryHustler
PRODUCTION: https://www.pantryhustler.com

CORE PRINCIPLES:
- Web-first SaaS MVP with Firebase backend
- All AI calls happen server-side via Firebase Functions
- No API keys or AI logic in frontend
- Proprietary recognition pipeline phased in over time
- User edits become labeled training data
- Auth = Firebase Auth only
- Payments = Stripe + PayPal with webhook entitlement gating

ENGINEERING RULES:
- Modular monorepo (apps/, functions/, packages/, infra/, docs/)
- Strong typing for shared contracts
- All features behind tier limits
- Graceful AI fallbacks on failures
- Log every AI request + cost metadata

QUALITY:
- Each slice deployable independently
- No breaking schema changes without migration
- Status.md updated after every milestone

AGENTS:
- Orchestrator controls sequencing
- Others execute only their domain

NO ASSUMPTIONS.
NO CLIENT AI CALLS.
NO HARDCODED SECRETS.
